runner.sh <project-dir> <log-file> <test-id>...
Runs the named tests. Prints "RAN <n>" and one "FAILED <test: message>" per failure.
Each executed assertion also emits EXECUTED followed by a JSON pair of source and
full test identity. Skipped cases do not emit this record. Vitest emits FAILED_ID
metadata to bind failures to file and name selectors.
Exit 0 all passed, 1 a test failed, 2 execution or evidence failed, 3 no test ran.
